External dependencies
---------------------
Project.toml declares Julia standard libraries and DataStructures, JuMP, Match,
MathOptInterface, Polynomials, PythonCall, SnoopPrecompile and Statistics.
CUDA.jl is optional. Julia's package manager obtains these dependencies under
their own license terms; their source trees are not bundled here.

GPU mode additionally requires the NVIDIA driver/toolkit and cuBLAS/cuSPARSE
under their applicable NVIDIA terms. No NVIDIA binaries are redistributed.
The optional Python/CVXPY integration needs its own Python, CVXPY and CuPy
environment; that integration was not exercised by the installation tests.

